[I] GitHub's official MCP Server

[T] The GitHub MCP Server connects AI tools directly to GitHub's platform. This
[T] gives AI agents, assistants, and chatbots the ability to read repositories
[T] and code files, manage issues and PRs, analyze code, and automate
[T] workflows. All through natural language interactions.

[U] https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server

[A] GitHub
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/ai
[F] CROSS
[R] + arm arm64 loongarch64 mips mips64 powerpc64 riscv64 s390x x86 x86-64

[L] MIT
[V] 2.1.0

[D] 57fd602fef8d386f92d7f8ac026e5ee0ffb3e86068f3a3c8a7837af0 github-mcp-server-2.1.0.tar.gz https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/archive/v2.1.0/

. $base/package/*/*/go-conf.in

var_append goconfopt ' ' '-o build/ ./cmd/github-mcp-server ./cmd/mcpcurl'
hook_add postmake 5 'cp -vf build/* $root$bindir/'
